FunctionalDecompositionExample --> Deal
FunctionalDecompositionExample --> CommissionPlan
ObjectOrientedDecompositionExample --> Deal
ObjectOrientedDecompositionExample --> CommissionPlan
DataDrivenDecompositionExample --> Deal
DataDrivenDecompositionExample --> CommissionPlan

